-         and `Endpoint.Streams(input, output)` one already running behind a pair of `java.io`
-         streams — in this process, behind a socket, or a fixture in a test. `Endpoint(command)`
-         and `Endpoint.streams(input, output)` build each, widened to `Endpoint`.
